Loops: Counting and Filtering

Counting Even Numbers


Show code
q4 &lt;- c(2, 5, 3, 9, 8, 11, 6)
count &lt;- 0

for (i in q4) {
  if (i %% 2 == 0) {
    count &lt;- count + 1
  }
}

paste("Even numbers found:", count)


[1] "Even numbers found: 3"




Conditional Printing with Loops


Show code
q5 &lt;- 1:8
for (i in seq_along(q5)) {
  val &lt;- q5[i]
  if (val &gt; 4 && val %% 2 == 0) {
    print(val)
  } else {
    print("Condition not satisfied")
  }
}


